capability File:
  state Opened, Read1, Read2, Closed
  start Opened
  stop Closed
  transition read Opened -> Read1, Read1 -> Read2
  def read <s read t> (): I64 <t>
  transition close Read1 -> Closed, Read2 -> Closed
  def close <s close t> (): Unit <t>

handler CFile for File:
  def read(): I64 = 7
  def close(): Unit = ()
